# Two instances of the image in one heap, as in objects-of-another-instance-behind-a-test-of-their-shape.ir. Here a field holds a function and a list holds things.
# A function of the other instance that lies in a field of ours, laid there by either instance, once and in a loop, runs with the variables of the instance that made it; so does `who` of each thing in a list into which both have pushed.
# Without the question for the instance behind a shape the list answered with one `mark` for all: 19 of 21.
